- 暂时不重要
	set {PlayerGender} = "unspecified"
你还记得你是谁吗？
[text_input text="" var="PlayerName"]
很好，看来一切正常。接下来，来听故事吧。
[signal arg="audio:stop_bgm"]
[signal arg="flow:demo_identity_finished"]
[end_timeline]
